# The deployed API. Committed on purpose rather than left as dashboard-only
# configuration: NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the client bundle at
# build time and are therefore public anyway, and keeping it here means the
# production build cannot silently fall back to localhost because someone
# forgot to set it in the Vercel project.
#
# Backend: Render service "SIH-2026" (see render.yaml + DEPLOY.md), which
# already allows CORS from https://fyro.vercel.app with credentials.
# A Vercel dashboard variable of the same name still overrides this file.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://sih-2026-f63s.onrender.com
